
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>St. John's University | Student Life</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f5f5f5;
            color: #222;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #b30824;
            color: white;
            padding: 25px 8%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 26px;
        }

        nav {
            background-color: #17264a;
            padding: 16px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 15px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #f2c94c;
        }

        .hero {
            background-color: #b30824;
            color: white;
            padding: 45px 8%;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero h2 {
            font-size: 36px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .hero img {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 850px;
            height: 350px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        main {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 30px 20px;
        }

        .section-title {
            color: #b30824;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .cards {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: white;
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 250px;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 3px 10px #ddd;
        }

        .card img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 190px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: #b30824;
        }

        .about {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 25px;
            margin-top: 30px;
            border-left: 5px solid #b30824;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #b30824;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 22px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .button:hover {
            background-color: #17264a;
        }

        footer {
            background-color: #17264a;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            header {
                text-align: center;
                justify-content: center;
                gap: 15px;
            }

            nav a {
                display: inline-block;
                margin: 8px;
            }

            .hero h2 {
                font-size: 28px;
            }

            .hero img {
                height: 230px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <h1>ST. JOHN'S UNIVERSITY</h1>
        <span>Queens, New York</span>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#campus">Campus Life</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>

    <section class="hero" id="home">
        <h2>Welcome to St. John's University</h2>
        <p>Discover your future. Find your passion. Become a Johnnie.</p>

        <img
            src="https://www.stjohns.edu/sites/default/files/styles/640w/public/2020-07/dsc_3764_300_960x640.jpg?itok=oBA6ZozQ"
            alt="St. John's University campus"
        >
    </section>

    <main>
        <h2 class="section-title" id="campus">
            Explore Campus Life
        </h2>

        <div class="cards">

            <div class="card">
                <img
                    src="https://www.stjohns.edu/sites/default/files/styles/640w/public/2020-07/dsc_3764_300_960x640.jpg?itok=oBA6ZozQ"
                    alt="University campus building"
                >

                <h3>Our Campus</h3>

                <p>
                    Experience university life on the beautiful
                    Queens campus in New York City.
                </p>

                <a
                    class="button"
                    href="https://www.stjohns.edu/queens-residential-campus"
                    target="_blank"
                >
                    Explore Campus
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <img
                    src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523050854058-8df90110c9f1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80"
                    alt="College students on campus"
                >

                <h3>Student Life</h3>

                <p>
                    Meet new people, join student organizations,
                    and create unforgettable college memories.
                </p>

                <a
                    class="button"
                    href="https://www.stjohns.edu/"
                    target="_blank"
                >
                    Learn More
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <img
                    src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523580846011-d3a5bc25702b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80"
                    alt="Students studying together"
                >

                <h3>Academics</h3>

                <p>
                    Discover opportunities to learn, grow,
                    and prepare for your future career.
                </p>

                <a
                    class="button"
                    href="https://www.stjohns.edu/academics"
                    target="_blank"
                >
                    Discover Programs
                </a>
            </div>

        </div>

        <section class="about" id="about">
            <h2>About St. John's</h2>

            <p>
                St. John's University is a university in New York
                that offers students opportunities to pursue
                their academic goals, participate in campus life,
                and prepare for their future careers.
            </p>

            <p>
                From academics to student organizations,
                there are many ways to get involved and make
                your college experience meaningful.
            </p>
        </section>

    </main>

    <footer id="contact">
        <h3>St. John's University</h3>
        <p>8000 Utopia Parkway, Queens, NY 11439</p>
        <p>Explore. Learn. Grow.</p>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Student Web Project</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
